## PR Title
axi_xbar: Improve compatibility with vsim 10.6c

## PR Description
This addresses a workaround for vsim 10.6c compatibility issues referenced in issue #133. The version reports an "illegal output or inout port connection for port 'slv_resp_o'" error (vsim-3053), which newer versions do not exhibit. The implementation preserves original functionality while resolving the simulator issue. Credit to jsailer for the implementation approach.

